    "description": {
      "content": "# Introduction\nThe Pryon API blah blah blah.\n\n# Authentication\nWhen you sign up for an account, you are given your set of API credentials.\n\n\nPryon supports authentication in the form of JSON Web Tokens.\n- JWT: authenticates each request by the http header: Authorization\n\nFor all API requests, you will have to include the Authorization header in the following form:\n\n```javascript\nAuthorization: Bearer {encoded token}\n```\n\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Pryon Product Support\n Email: support@pryoninc.com",
      "type": "text/plain"
